    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i mean i have been pretty stressed lately with work, so that makes sense. but sometimes it feels a bit more intense than just being tired, like a sudden gap in my head. but if it's just brain fog, i can probably just fix it with some vitamins or maybe something like melatonin? do u think that would help clear the fog up pretty quick?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
