    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really hate going to the doctor, it's so expensive and honestly just a huge hassle. do u think it's really necessary for something like this? if it eventually goes away on its own once i'm less stressed, it's probably not worth the bill, right? seems like it's mostly just a lifestyle thing.",
